p":163,"b":8,"s":"MS. VANCE","x":"She had so much humor --"},{"p":163,"b":9,"s":"MR. NORVO","x":"Oh, yeah."},{"p":163,"b":10,"s":"MS. VANCE","x":"Didn't she?"},{"p":163,"b":11,"s":"MR. NORVO","x":"Funny, we used to laugh and go --"}]}